308 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (The ruling also reflects a recurring pattern: courts strike down defective orders but allow the department to redo the assessment, offering taxpayers procedural relief but rarely substantive finality. Importantly, Form DRC-07 is only a statutory summary; if the underlying speaking order is properly signed, a missing signature on DRC-07 may amount to a curable defect.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [3]
>>
